hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16844","He said: Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, he said: Hammad ibn Zayd informed us from Muhammad ibn Ishaq from Yazid ibn Abi Habib from Marthad ibn Abd Allah al-Yazani from Malik ibn Hubayra, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: There is no believer who dies and a community of Muslims prays over him reaching three rows but that he is forgiven. He said: And Malik ibn Hubayra used to take care, when the people of a funeral were few, to make them three rows."
